steps.instruction:
In SAS Studio press F4 to open a new SAS program, then paste the following code to import every macro:
%let macrodir=%sysfunc(pathname(HOME))/Macros;
%include "&macrodir./importallmacros_ue.sas";
%importallmacros_ue;

Standardize the severity variable in sc.umap:
data sc.umap;
  set sc.umap;
  if severity="healthy_control" then severity="Healthy";
  if severity="severe" then severity="Severe";
  if severity="critical" then severity="Critical";
run;

Create a dataset that defines cell type and age groups:
data tgt;
  length cell_type $50.;
  set new__tgt_dsd_;
  cell_type="Other";
  if prxmatch('/Ciliated/i',Cluster) then cell_type=Cluster;
  if age>60 then Old='Yes'; else Old='No';
run;
